    "detailed_description": "Minesweeper is back, and this time it's personal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelive the suspense and excitement of old-school minesweeper in classic mode.<br />\r\nEnjoy all three standard minesweeper boards, with an atmospheric soundtrack and choice of visual styles.<br />\r\nAvoid sticky situations using hints to eliminate guesswork.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew challenges await you with hex and triangular game modes.<br />\r\nTake your minesweeper skills to a whole new level!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEarn achievements by completing minesweeper boards quickly. <br />\r\nCompete against the best minesweepers by setting high scores on worldwide leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Let's play minesweeper!",
